OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after unrest following
OL,4,Avisit from former US President Biden
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in relation to a
OL,7,F"public order incident" following a
OL,8,Fvisit by former US President Joe Biden
OL,9,Fto Trinity College in Dublin.
OL,11,FBiden was accompanied by former first
OL,12,Flady Jill Biden as they attended a
OL,13,Fceremony on Tuesday where their son
OL,14,FHunter was awarded the Gold Medal for
OL,15,FOutstanding Contribution for Public
OL,16,FDiscourse.
OL,18,FDuring the trio's visit to the College
OL,19,FHistorical Society groups of
OL,20,Fpro-Palestinian protesters gathered,
OL,21,Fsome of whom were detained by gardai
OL,22,F(Irish police).
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
