OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after unrest following
OL,4,Avisit from former US President Biden
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai said the man, aged in his 50s,
OL,7,Fwas one of three arrested on Tuesday.
OL,8,FThe other two men, one aged in his 30s
OL,9,Fand the other in his late teens, have
OL,10,Fbeen released without charge.
